{
  "chunk_seq": 7,
  "chunk_id": "01a0740e-3007-763d-bc05-fcd31c3ba548_007",
  "doc_id": "01a0740e-3007-763d-bc05-fcd31c3ba548",
  "text": "### FirstUK Bank's Role  \n**When Mandate Reaches FirstUK:**\n1. Mandate received from biller or customer\n2. Account details verified (valid format, exists)\n3. Customer identity confirmed\n4. Mandate recorded in system\n5. Biller notified of setup (ARUDD message)\n6. Customer receives confirmation  \n**Note:** FirstUK doesn't issue the mandate; customer signs it and biller sends it to us  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 7/26",
  "_domain": "banking.sop_guides",
  "prev_chunk_id": "01a0740e-3007-763d-bc05-fcd31c3ba548_006",
  "next_chunk_id": "01a0740e-3007-763d-bc05-fcd31c3ba548_008",
